{"ref":"BDB, לֶ֫קֶט","hw":"לֶ֫קֶט","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">לֶ֫קֶט</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>gleaning</strong>, i.e. what is or may be gleaned, only cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">ל׳ קְצִירְךָ</span>, as acc. cogn. with <span dir=\"rtl\">לקט</span> Pi., (q.v.) <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:9\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.9\">Lv 19:9</a> = <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 23:22\" href=\"/Leviticus.23.22\">23:22</a> (H).","next":"BDB, יַלְקוּט²","prev":"BDB, לָקַט"}